          Merlin’s Big Surprise
        </h1>

        <p class='case-subtitle'>
          A complete children’s book illustration commission developed from traditional pencil
          sketches to finished digital artwork and publication.
        </p>

        <dl class='case-summary' aria-label='Project summary'>
          <div>
            <dt>Role</dt>
            <dd>Illustrator</dd>
          </div>

          <div>
            <dt>Client</dt>
            <dd>Author Agi Kiss</dd>
