          <figcaption class='case-caption'>
            A more detailed action scene with both characters and a complete illustrated environment
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='row case-outcome'>
      <h2 class='case-section-heading'>Outcome and reflection</h2>

      <p>
        I completed the full illustration set and carried the visual work through revisions and
        approval to publication.
        <em>Merlin’s Big Surprise</em>
        was produced as a physical book, translated into several languages, and made available
        through international retailers.
      </p>

      <p>
        The project demonstrates my ability to manage a detailed, long-form illustration commission
        from early sketches and character development through digital production and final
        publication. It also strengthened my experience in visual storytelling, character
        consistency, print preparation, and responding carefully to detailed client and publisher
        feedback.
      </p>

      <p class='case-caption'>
        Written by Agi Kiss · Illustrated by Katja Turnsek · Publisher shown on this edition: Göncöl
      </p>
